{
 "identification": "No. 9, Yuyuan Road 1107. Same gable, three axes numbered from left towards porch as viewed. Different 2015 / 2023 exposures.",
 "historic_date": "2015-08-01 16:54:28 EXIF orientation 3",
 "modern_date": "Front author published digital photo in 2023-09; native publication files 14 (diagonal), 18 (front).",
 "observations": [
  "The 2023 diagonal photograph shows a strong central meeting stile and two much lighter horizontal lines across each upper leaf. They are represented with shallow glazing bars set behind the heavy exterior frame.",
  "The lower row shows a stout crossrail, paired small upper sashes and thin bars in the lower light. Outer two lower lights look pale or opaque in both photographs. The centre window is substantially darker.",
  "Each head has two projecting light-coloured members with a darker horizontal line between them. The long separate dark member above the 2015 caps has been removed or reduced to small central mounts (upper) and mainly paired mounts (lower) by 2023. The white horizontal member below each upper window has two distinct edges.",
  "Front gable has one broad vertical projection between axes 1 and 2. The upper and widened lower stages join at a sloping shoulder about level with the upper glass heads. Its light and shade change with viewpoint."
 ],
 "precision": "On 2015 rectified display about 1–2 of 1050 px across the image (5–10 native pixels), and 1–3 original pixels in the 2023 photograph. Leaf tops and planting obscure some sill and shaft endpoints.",
